      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that seems like a solid starting point. can you go into more detail on step 6? you mentioned people might get frustrated, but what specifically should we look out for in terms of security vulnerabilities during this rollout? like, what are the actual threats we are trying to mitigate by moving away from sms?",
